{"id":"n72443-1-9","stage":3,"title":"유도 · 诱导","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72443-1-9-1","ko":"시청자들의 반응이 좋지 않은데요?","zh":"观众的反馈似乎不太好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시청자들의","meaning":"观众","explanation":"시청자：观众；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"시청자","audio":"/audio/58b58ce02f2391932c0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65314","senseId":"1","lemma":"시청자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시청자들의","audio":"/audio/04b4d854dbdf6d9143fc.mp3"}},{"text":"반응이","meaning":"反应","explanation":"반응：反应；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"반응","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15850","senseId":"1","lemma":"반응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반응이","audio":"/audio/5ea0639ca3fec2fdb66f.mp3"}},{"text":"좋지","meaning":"好","explanation":"좋다：好；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋지","audio":"/audio/93fe8dafc60040a28c9b.mp3"}},{"text":"않은데요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않은데요","audio":"/audio/208630e39e37588e4606.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"58b58ce02f239193","term":"시청자","zh":"观众","audio":"/audio/58b58ce02f2391932c0f.mp3","entryId":"65314","definition":"收看电视节目的人。","pronunciation":["시ː청자"]},{"id":"791889c5b68580a4","term":"반응","zh":"反应","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3","entryId":"15850","definition":"对某种刺激表现出一定的动作或态度；或指那种动作或态度。","pronunciation":["바ː능"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"好","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e1a53c6d7136a85fbec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72443-1-9-2","ko":"글쎄요. 관심 유도를 할 수 있는 방법이 없을까요?","zh":"嗯……有没有什么办法可以吸引他们的兴趣呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄요.","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄요：也许吧，或许吧，难说。","readings":[{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60633","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄요","audio":"/audio/b6013caa74979f40ee06.mp3"}},{"text":"관심","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}},{"text":"유도를","meaning":"诱导，引导","explanation":"유도：诱导，引导；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유도","audio":"/audio/4fbbb8d808d8929777a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72443","senseId":"1","lemma":"유도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유도를","audio":"/audio/f7fc05b6e354b0e278cd.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 